<view class="page" style="{{themeStyle}}"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKSPACE</view><view class="title">我的医栈通</view><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="demo">演示工作区 · 数据仅留在当前设备</view>
  <view class="card profile-card"><image class="small-logo" src="/assets/icon.png"/><view><view class="section-title">{{user.name || '医栈通用户'}}</view><view class="caption">{{user.email || '演示账号'}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="card section row" bindtap="settings"><view class="section-title">设置</view><text class="muted">主题与小组件　›</text></view>
  <view class="card section"><view class="section-title">云同步</view><view class="notice">{{status}}</view><view class="caption">云端版本 {{cloudVersion}} · 任务、日程、课表、专注记录</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || demo}}" bindtap="sync">立即同步</button><view wx:if="{{conflict}}"><view class="notice">两端都有修改，请选择要保留的完整版本。</view><button class="secondary" data-choice="local" bindtap="resolve" disabled="{{busy}}">保留本机版本</button><button class="secondary" data-choice="remote" bindtap="resolve" disabled="{{busy}}">保留云端版本</button></view></view>
  <view class="section-title section">回收站</view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{trash}}" wx:key="id" class="record-row"><text class="grow">{{item.title}}</text><button class="text-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-kind="{{item.kind}}" bindtap="restore">恢复</button></view><view wx:if="{{!trash.length}}" class="empty">没有已删除的任务或日程。</view></view>
  <view class="card section"><view class="section-title">关于首版</view><view class="caption paragraph">v{{version}} · 开发预览</view><view class="caption paragraph">课表由桌面端刷新，再通过云同步带入。Poseidon、校园登录和微信消息提醒尚未接入本版。</view><view class="caption paragraph">登录会话仅保留在内存；不在小程序保存密码或模型密钥。本机工作区按账号分别保存。</view></view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">{{demo ? '退出演示' : '退出登录'}}</button>
</view>
